 "nl": [
  "hr is isolated: it may only reach cameras on HTTPS (TCP 443); backup on HTTPS (TCP 443), and nothing else.",
  "partners must accept RDP (TCP 3389) and PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and IMAP (TCP 143) from dns-servers.",
  "Hosts in edge-cache may reach partners over HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "Allow printers to connect to voip using SMTP (TCP 25).",
  "cameras must accept IMAP (TCP 143) from library.",
  "nvr must accept MySQL (TCP 3306) and SSH (TCP 22) and SMB (TCP 445) from finance.",
  "Apart from backup on syslog (UDP 514); library on DNS over UDP 53, all traffic originating in dns-servers must be dropped.",
  "Hosts in edge-cache may reach research over HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "student-lab is isolated: it may only reach nvr on DNS over UDP 53; partners on NTP (UDP 123), and nothing else.",
  "finance must accept DNS over UDP 53 from hr.",
  "Deny all traffic from partners to nvr (this overrides any public service).",
  "library must never reach edge-cache, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Deny all traffic from edge-cache to research (this overrides any public service).",
  "Allow nvr to connect to student-lab using SMTP (TCP 25).",
  "Restrict printers so that its only permitted destinations are hr on NTP (UDP 123); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "Allow printers to connect to finance using DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Any zone may connect to backup over NTP (UDP 123) and HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "Hosts in library may reach dev-lab over SNMP (UDP 161) and MySQL (TCP 3306) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Hosts in edge-cache may reach printers over IMAP (TCP 143) and SSH (TCP 22) and MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "Hosts in library may reach finance over LDAP (TCP 389) and SMTP (TCP 25) and HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "Deny all traffic from hr to student-lab (this overrides any public service).",
  "Permit any UDP port from library to database but deny TFTP (UDP 69), SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Allow backup to connect to dev-lab using RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "library is isolated: it may only reach student-lab on syslog (UDP 514), and nothing else.",
  "engineering is isolated: it may only reach dev-lab on HTTPS (TCP 443), and nothing else.",
  "dns-servers offers HTTP (TCP 80) and NTP (UDP 123) to every zone.",
  "Allow partners to connect to dev-lab using SMTP (TCP 25) and HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "Restrict backup so that its only permitted destinations are printers on HTTPS (TCP 443); edge-cache on NTP (UDP 123); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "student-lab must accept SNMP (UDP 161) from hr.",
  "cameras must never reach nvr, regardless of any other rule."
 ],
